					<div class="box-text">
						<ul>
    <li><span lang="EN-US">Click the tab&nbsp;<b>Listing Applications</b>&nbsp;to view the applications submitted to the BMV for securities listing approval.</span></li>
</ul>
<ul>
    <li>Check the filings in process which contain all the <b>documents</b> and the <b>essential information</b> for listing securities by clicking on <b>Listing Filings</b>.</li>
</ul>
<p>Download the <u><a href="/work/models/Grupo_BMV/Resource/984/1/images/CRITERIOS_MINIMOS_29-09-25%20(1).pdf">Minimum Criteria for Acceptance</a></u> and the document where the <u><a href="/work/models/Grupo_BMV/Resource/984/1/images/TIEMPOS_DE_RESPUESTA_2025_09.pdf">Response Times</a></u> from the BMV to attend the listing filings are stated.</p>
<p>Additionally, for the Mexican Stock Exchange the sustainability of the companies listed on it is very important, so we make available to the issuers an optional assessment to identify their level of maturity in environmental, social and corporate governance issues at the time of listing. <a href="/work/models/Grupo_BMV/Resource/984/1/images/CUESTIONARIO_ASG.pdf">Click here to download</a>.</p>
